COVERAGE: 2 sample(s) of /budget/odds, 60s apart, on 2026-10-11.
It sees the UTC day's cumulative degrade counter only. A monthly batch throw
that happens outside this interval is invisible here, which is why the
interval has to show spend before a flat count is read as a pass.

UNREADABLE fails on purpose: a counter that cannot be read is not evidence.
